OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a
OL,6,Fgenerally wet evening, with outbreaks
OL,7,Fof rain throughout, some isolated
OL,8,Fclear patches later into the early
OL,9,Fhours, with winds gradually increasing
OL,10,Finto the morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FSaturday will be an
OL,13,Funsettled day. It will be cloudy and
OL,14,Fbreezy with outbreaks of rain, some of
OL,15,Fwhich will be heavy, especially around
OL,16,Fthe middle of the day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
